      },
      "cr": 1,
      "biography": {
        "value": "<p><em>Waluipedia cast sheet — Beta Luigi.</em> Built by <code>tools/build-character-sheets.py</code>, generated from the article's own words. no XP ledger entry; archetype default → CR 1 as a spirit. Numbers are a GM-ready reading of the record, not a filed stat line; the article stays the authority. Archive date 1040 BF.</p><p><strong>The Brother Left Alone</strong> — None — formerly beside Mario; now acting strictly alone</p><p>Status: Active — walked out of the Archive Hall alone on 3 Aethel, 1035 BF carrying an unnamed volume pulled from the shelves after swearing to make them atone alone</p><p>A hollow-eyed, grief-wrecked figure in stained green overalls, heavy tool belt, and low-pulled cap who entered the Archive Hall during a thunderstorm as the third haunting of the week. Followed by a singing chorus of ghosts, a fifteen-foot angry crimson phantom, and Mario's disembodied voice answering in Italian ('Ti perdono. Vai avanti'), he crushed a working Fire Flower under his boot, wept out the whole of 'Alone' on the stone floor, took one book from the shelf, and walked out by himself.</p><h3>Evidence</h3><ul><li><strong>Withering Touch</strong> — “The Brother Left Alone”</li><li><strong>Incorporeal Movement</strong> — “Followed by a singing chorus of ghosts, a fifteen-foot angry crimson phantom, and Mario's disembodied voice answering in Italian ('Ti perdono.”</li></ul><p>Article: <code>#/article/beta_luigi</code> (characters). Site sheet: <code>#/sheets/beta_luigi</code>.</p>",
        "public": ""
      }
    },
